\v 13 [Then said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w Haggai| strong="H2292" \w*, If one that is \w unclean| strong="H2931" \w* \w by a dead body| strong="H5315" \w* [touch]{strong=“H5060” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [any of these, shall it be unclean]{strong=“H2930” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}? \w And the priests| strong="H3548" \w* [answered]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [It shall be unclean]{strong=“H2930” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
